    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Onboard charger</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ko">AC 충전 때 입력 AC를 배터리 충전용 DC로 변환하고 충전 설비와 통신한다.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">For AC charging, converts input AC to battery-charging DC and communicates with charging equipment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/custom/electric-vehicle#PowertrainComponent"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/custom/electric-vehicle#EnergyFlow">
